I think it would be fun to have really oddball abilities for various 
gems to give more characters chances to know their type without granting 
an ID that can be cashed in at a store.  (And shouldn't more store types 
accept IDed gems?)

Tourmaline (add, just about any color): Absorbs one lightining attack 
and is destroyed.

Opal: Carrying one or more adds +1 to IQ for searching only.

Diamond: Carrying one or more reduces confusion or hallucination by one 
turn.

Citrine: Each one gives a 5% chance of foiling a money stealing attack.

Emerald: Carrying one or more adds +1 to rolls against drowning.

Amber: Dipped in Poison to convert to Booze.

Garnet: Gives a tiny chance of avoiding poison effects.

Dilithium Crystal: Consumed in Fusion Sword Hilts.

And so on.

